OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOne or two
OL,6,Fshowers will continue during the
OL,7,Fevening and into the overnight period,
OL,8,Fthough for many it will become dry.
OL,9,FClear spells developing. A mild night
OL,10,Fahead with temperatures in rural areas
OL,11,Fdipping slightly lower.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FAn isolated light shower is
OL,14,Fpossible on Monday, especially in the
OL,15,Fmorning. Most areas will have a fine
OL,16,Fday though with variable cloud and
OL,17,Fbright spells. Warm in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
