OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FThough
OL,6,Fthe odd spot of rain cannot be ruled
OL,7,Fout during the period, most places
OL,8,Fshould hold onto fine weather.
OL,9,FTemperatures will increase slightly,
OL,10,Ffeeling very warm in lighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
